koezoe02	null	COseer3	null: LOCALIZERS: spoken, evil and ruthless: 'This is the head of Overseer Fanret. He let two of the Fire witches escape. When you deal with the rabble that visit that elf healer, the Mistress bids you to remember our departed friend, Overseer Fanret.'
